---
import AboutStats from './AboutStats.astro';
---

<div>
  <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] font-bold text-[var(--color-about-navy)] leading-tight mb-[24px]">
    Ascension Moving Company — <br class="hidden lg:block" />
    <span class="inline-block bg-[var(--color-about-primary)] text-white px-4 py-1 rounded-[12px] mt-2 leading-tight">Your Move, Your Way!</span>
  </h2>
  
  <div class="space-y-[20px] text-[var(--color-about-text)] text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] max-w-[720px] mb-[40px]">
    <p>
      Moving isn't just about transporting boxes—it's about helping people begin their next chapter with confidence.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since 2020, Ascension Moving Company has proudly served Traverse City and communities across Northern Michigan with <span class="text-[var(--color-about-primary)] font-semibold">dependable residential and commercial moving services</span>. Whether you're moving across town or across the state, our experienced team handles every item with professionalism, care, and respect.
    </p>
    <p>
      From expert packing and careful loading to specialty item transportation and senior relocations, we make every move <span class="text-[var(--color-about-primary)] font-semibold">simple, efficient, and stress-free</span>. Our goal is to provide a moving experience that's organized from start to finish, so you can focus on settling into your new home.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you choose Ascension Moving Company, you're choosing movers who treat your belongings like their own.
    </p>
  </div>
  
  <AboutStats />
</div>
